        },
        {
          "text": "the fucking fire department—the neighborhoods liquidate themselves",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5044
        }
      ],
      "words": 30
    },
    {
      "block": "原句12",
      "no": 12,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "But I think that if you deal with pain all the time, you get used to it. Or, not used to it. Attracted to it. You don’t ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10900
        }
      ],
      "words": 30
    },
    {
      "block": "原句13",
      "no": 13,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "We weren’t family—we were friends, which meant more to me",
          "ok": true,
